# custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 現在、こちらの窓口は準備中となります。<br>また後ほど、訪れてくださいね。
#. de: Dieser Schalter ist momentan geschlossen. Bitte versuche es später noch einmal.
#. fr: Pardonnez-moi, notre comptoir n'est pas encore opérationnel. Je vous prie de bien vouloir revenir plus tard, lorsque nous serons ouverts.
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_ERROR_DISABLE:1"
msgid "My apologies, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>, but we're not able to accept new clientele at present. "
msgstr ""

#. ja: 現在、雇用しているリテイナーはいないようです。
#. de: Du hast momentan gar keinen Gehilfen.
#. fr: Je regrette, mais vous n'avez ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment aucun servant à votre service...
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_ERROR_RETAINER_COUNT:1"
msgid "It does not appear you have any retainers in your employ at this time."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 契約切れのため、リテイナーの手続きができません。
#. de: Du kannst keinen Gehilfen anstellen, weil der Vertrag ausgelaufen ist.
#. fr: Impossible d'effectuer cette action. Vous devez d'abord vous réabonner au service de servants.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_ERROR_RETAINER_CHARGE:1"
msgid "You cannot perform this action until you have purchased the services of an additional retainer."
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらは、クリスタリウムの商業区、<br>ムジカ・ユニバーサリスの登録窓口となります。<br>ご用件を伺いましょう。
#. de: Das hier ist der Registrierungsschalter der Musica Universalis. Möchtest du in diesem Handelsbezirk geschäftlich aktiv werden?
#. fr: Bonjour, <if $gn4>Madame<else>Monsieur</if>. Bienvenue à Musica Universalis, le quartier marchand de Cristarium. Que puis-je faire pour vous<nbsp>?
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_DEFAULT_TALK_01:1"
msgid "Ah, <string $gs1>. Welcome to Musica Universalis. How may I help you?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ピクシー族を仲介役にして、<br>登録マーケットをクリスタリウムへ<br>変更したいリテイナーを選んでください。
#. de: Bitte wähle den Gehilfen aus, den die Pixies für dich auf den Markt von Crystarium schicken sollen.
#. fr: Choisissez le servant que vous désirez assigner au marché de Cristarium.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_REGISTER_TALK_01:1"
msgid "May I have the name of a retainer you wish to dispatch? The Crystal Exarch has asked that Feo Ul serve as their intermediary. How they would accomplish this, well... I thought it better not to ask. "
msgstr ""

#. ja: リテイナー<string $s1>の登録マーケットを<br>クリスタリウムに変更してもいいですか？
#. de: <string $s1> auf den Markt von Crystarium schicken?
#. fr: Assigner <string $s1> à Cristarium<nbsp>?
#. macro: <capitalize><string $s1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_REGISTER_ASK:1"
msgid "Send <capitalize><string $s1></capitalize> to the Crystarium?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: リテイナー<string $s1>が<br>クリスタリウムのマーケットに登録変更されました。
#. de: <string $s1> wurde erfolgreich auf den Markt von Crystarium geschickt.
#. fr: Le servant “<string $s1>” est désormais inscrit au marché de Cristarium.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_REGISTER_SUCCESS:1"
msgid "Very good. I will see to it Feo Ul contact them right away."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そのリテイナーはすでにクリスタリウムの<br>マーケットに登録されています。
#. de: Dieser Gehilfe ist bereits auf dem Markt von Crystarium.
#. fr: Ce servant est déjà inscrit au marché de Cristarium.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_REGISTER_ALREADY:1"
msgid "I do believe that retainer has already been dispatched to the Crystarium."
msgstr ""

#. ja: リテイナーをマーケットへ登録できませんでした。
#. de: Der Gehilfe konnte nicht auf den Markt geschickt werden.
#. fr: Impossible d'inscrire le servant au marché.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_REGISTER_FAILED:1"
msgid "The retainer was unable to meet with Feo Ul."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 用件は？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_MAIN_MENU_TITLE:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: リテイナーをクリスタリウムマーケットに登録したい
#. de: Ich möchte einen Gehilfen auf den Markt von Crystarium schicken.
#. fr: Inscrire un servant à Cristarium
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_MAIN_MENU_REGISTER:1"
msgid "Dispatch a retainer to the Crystarium."
msgstr ""

#. ja: クリスタリウムマーケットについて聞きたい
#. de: Ich möchte mehr über den Markt von Crystarium erfahren.
#. fr: En savoir plus sur le marché de Cristarium
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_MAIN_MENU_ABOUT:1"
msgid "Ask about the Crystarium market."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 各マーケットの減税情報を知りたい
#. de: Ich möchte wissen, wo die Steuern zurzeit niedrig sind.
#. fr: S'enquérir des taxes aux marchés
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_MAIN_MENU_CASHBACK:1"
msgid "View market tax rates."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen.
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_MAIN_MENU_CANCEL:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ja: クリスタリウムの商業区、ムジカ・ユニバーサリスでは、<br>マーケットで売買を行うリテイナーの登録が可能です。
#. de: Du kannst einen Gehilfen in den Handelsbezirk von Crystarium, Musica Universalis, schicken, um dort auf dem Markt Handel zu treiben.
#. fr: Le marché de Cristarium, ou Musica Universalis comme nous l'appelons, est le principal lieu d'échange de la cité. Si vous avez des servants, c'est ici qu'ils officieront.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_MAIN_MENU_ABOUT_01:1"
msgid "The Crystarium's market is by no means large, but you're more than welcome to sell your wares here."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なんでも、お客様の場合、<br>ピクシー族を仲介役としたいのだとか？<br>もちろん問題ございませんので、どうかご安心ください。
#. de: Du möchtest eine Pixie als Vermittler einsetzen? Das ist selbst<shy>verständ<shy>lich kein Problem, nur keine Sorge!
#. fr: J'ai ouï dire que dans votre cas, une Pixie vous servirait d'intermédiaire<nbsp>? Ne vous en faites pas, ça ne pose aucun problème.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_MAIN_MENU_ABOUT_02:1"
msgid "The Crystal Exarch tells me Feo Ul has been charged with retrieving your things, from...where are you from again, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: マーケットの減税情報
#. de: Steuersenkungen
#. fr: Taxes des marchés
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_CASHBACK_ASK_TITLE:1"
msgid "Current Market Tax Rates:"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet Town $n1 0>　[減税あり]
#. de: <sheet Town $n1 0>: Steuern gesenkt
#. fr: <sheet Town $n1 0><nbsp>: taxe réduite
#. macro: <sheet Town $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Town, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_CASHBACK_ASK:1"
msgid "<sheet Town $n1 0>: Reduced"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet Town $n1 0>　[減税なし]
#. de: <sheet Town $n1 0>: Steuern nicht gesenkt
#. fr: <sheet Town $n1 0><nbsp>: taxe normale
#. macro: <sheet Town $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Town, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_CASHBACK_ASK_NONE:1"
msgid "<sheet Town $n1 0>: Normal"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 減税とは
#. de: Über Steuersenkungen
#. fr: Savoir à quoi servent les réductions de taxe
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_CASHBACK_ASK_ABOUT:1"
msgid "Learn about Market Tax"
msgstr ""

#. ja: もどる
#. de: Zurück
#. fr: Retour
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_CASHBACK_ASK_CANCEL:1"
msgid "Return"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 現在<sheet Town $n1 0>では減税は実施しておらず、<br>出品したアイテムが売れた時の税金は、売値の<num $n2>％です。
#. de: Momentan gibt es in <sheet Town $n1 0> keine Steuersenkung. Die Steuer beträgt <num $n2><nbsp>% des Verkaufspreises.
#. fr: La taxe sur les objets vendus à <sheet Town $n1 0> est au taux normal de <num $n2>% du prix de vente.
#. macro: <sheet Town $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Town, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_NO_CASHBACK:1"
msgid "Tax on items sold in the <sheet Town $n1 0> markets is the normal rate of <num $n2>%."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet Town $n1 0>では<set-time $n2><num $year>/<num $month>/<num $day>まで、<num $n3>％の減税実施中です。<br><sheet Town $n1 0>で出品したアイテムが売れた時の税金は<br>売値の<num $n4>％となります。
#. de: In <sheet Town $n1 0> ist bis <set-time $n2><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> die Steuer um <num $n3> Prozentpunkte gesenkt. Sie beträgt aktuell <num $n4><nbsp>% des Verkaufspreises.
#. fr: La taxe sur les objets vendus à <sheet Town $n1 0> est réduite de <num $n3>% jusqu'au <set-time $n2><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> (temps réel)<nbsp>! Le prélèvement est donc de <num $n4>% du prix de vente.
#. macro: <sheet Town $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Town, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n4> — a number; value = number parameter 4 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <set-time $n2> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn77 == 3)> <num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 77 == 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $day> — a number; value = day of the month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $month> — a number; value = month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $year> — a number; value = year of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_CASHBACK:1"
msgid "Tax on items sold in the <sheet Town $n1 0> markets is reduced to <num $n4>% until <set-time $n2><if ($gn77 == 3)> <num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> (Earth date)."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 出品しているリテイナーが少ない国のマーケットでは、<br>出品したアイテムが売れた時に徴収している税金を減税して<br>出品者を優遇することがあります。
#. de: Stadt<shy>staaten, in denen nur wenige Gehilfen Gegenstände verkaufen, reduzieren die Verkaufssteuer, um die Wirtschaft anzukurbeln.
#. fr: Il arrive souvent que les cités réduisent la taxe qu'elles prélèvent sur les ventes afin de favoriser l'activité de leur marché.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_CASHBACK_ABOUT_01:1"
msgid "To make their markets more attractive to prospective sellers, cities will often lower the percentage of tax that is collected from each sale."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 減税の実施はメンテナンスなどで<br>予定より早期終了する場合があります。<br>ご了承ください。
#. de: Es ist möglich, dass die Steuersenkung vor dem angekündigten Endtermin aufgehoben wird. Die Finanzminister bitten um Ihr Verständnis.
#. fr: Les périodes de réduction peuvent être plus courtes qu'annoncées si une maintenance est nécessaire dans la zone concernée.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerMarketRegister_00581:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERMARKETREGISTER_00581_CASHBACK_ABOUT_02:1"
msgid "Reduced tax rate periods can end earlier than indicated if areas require maintenance."
msgstr ""
